'''Paarbahlot''' is a feldgrau-green [[ON:Dragon|dragon]] that has allied himself with [[ON:Laatvulon|Laatvulon]]. He will be present when [[ON:Joorahmaar|Joorahmaar]] is discussing the promise of power with Laatvulon, and will fly off with Joorahmaar when you disrupt the aeonstone ritual.
{{NewLeft}}
==Related Quests==
* {{Quest Link|Order of the New Moon}}

==Quest-Related Events==
===Order of the New Moon===
Paarbahlot is first seen in [[ON:New Moon Fortress|New Moon Fortress]]. He is part of the meeting with Laatvulon and Joorahmaar and listens to the conversation.
:'''Joorahmaar:''' ''"You promised us power, Laatvulon."''
:'''Laatvulon:''' ''"And you shall have it, my brother."''
:'''Laatvulon:''' ''"The New Moon will rise above, and all who obey shall rise with it!"''
:'''Laatvulon:''' ''"Relinquish your strength to the aeonstone! Offer your power to our noble cause!"''

When you disrupt the ritual, Paarbahlot flies off.

==Notes==
* He doesn't have a nameplate. The only way to discern his name is from subtitles.
* He shares the same model as [[ON:Bahlokdaan|Bahlokdaan]].
* His name means "Ambition-Wrath-Great" in [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Language]].
